 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Keep it simple. A short welcome, a statement about the couple's love, and a short speech from someone close. A family member or close friend knows the couple well. Their job is to share a favourite memory or something personal about their relationship. A short ritual before the couple arrive could work. A simple lighting of candles, sharing of food and drink, and some music would feel special without being heavy. Of course. A small tree or shrub in a container is easy to look after and gives a touch of green.",
